  "decision": "Reject and do not add streams, events, workspace partitioning, a runtime selector, or a rollback flag. Q5 loses on XTX, while the heavier Q4 threshold case is only modestly positive on XTX and decisively regresses W7900. Wider Q4/Q6 roles would require changing the independently qualified tile geometry to fit two weight planes and are not justified after the same-geometry cross-board failure."
